<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown cut HCIA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown cut HCIA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it downgraded HCIA Inc to market perform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- HCIA said Monday it expects to report a second-quarter loss due to a revenue shortfall at its provider solutions unit.</p>
<p>-- HCIA lost 17-1/4 to 14-3/4.</p>
</text>
